  "description": "One value of a live session, as its session describes it: what kind of thing it is (a table, a model, a vector, a list, a function or a value), short facts, and one page of its rows, elements or parts, each part with the code that reaches it. Never starts a session or waits for a cell: while a cell runs or waits the answer is busy. A reading that takes too long is interrupted."
